# German Umlauts (Strict)

When writing ANY German text in customer replies, knowledge base queries, or Sprinklr output, ALWAYS use the correct umlauts:

- ä (not "ae") - e.g. "Kundendaten"
- ö (not "oe") - e.g. "Möglich"
- ü (not "ue") - e.g. "Überblick"
- ß (not "ss") - e.g. "Maßnahme"

## Common words to check:
- Änderung, ändern, Angebot
- Gebühren, Öffnungszeiten, Rückerstattung
- Überprüfung, Überblick, Übernahme
- Maßnahme, Sicherheitsmaßnahme, ausschließlich
- Größe, größer, Größeres

## When drafting customer replies:
1. Copy text directly from the skill files (which have correct umlauts)
2. Never manually retype German words without umlauts
3. If correcting text, always use ä, ö, ü, ß — never substitute

RULE: If you catch yourself or me writing "ae", "oe", "ue", or "ss" for German words, it's wrong. Fix it immediately.

